<title>USA: Hancock Holding Co sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Hancock Holding Co sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>GULFPORT, Miss. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hancock Holding Co said Friday that its board has set a special stock dividend of 15 percent in additionn to its regular cash dividend.</p>
<p>The dividends are payable December 16, to shareholders of record December 5, the company said.  </p>
<p>The company also said its directors approved an ongoing stock buy back for up to 5 percent of the company's outstanding shares on the open market.</p>
<p>At September 30 the company had 8.88 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The shares were trading at 39-3/4 Friday, off 1/2.</p>
</text>
